{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46249","headline":"别卢使君归东阳二首 二 · 贯休","name":"别卢使君归东阳二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家在严陵钓渚旁，细涟嘉树拂窗凉。\n难医林薮烟霞癖，又出芝兰父母乡。\n孤帆好风千里煖，深花黄鸟一声长。\n终期金鼎调羹日，再近尼丘日月光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}